    "Id": "mechdef_excalibur_EXC-B2-RISC",
    "Name": "Excalibur EXC-B2-RISC",
    "Details": "Patterned after the sturdy Royal variant, the EXC-B2-RISC is optimized for headhunter and ambush missions. The centerpiece of its design is a First Star League-vintage null-signature system, sourced from former ComStar supply depots, which renders the unit largely immune to enemy target locks. Sporting a Clan-spec LRM launcher mated with an advanced Artemis-V guidance system, alongside the signature Gauss rifle, the EXC-B2-RISC can engage at standoff range to maximize its stealth advantage. While efficient use of its mobility, firepower and defensive systems should make overheating a rare concern, the extreme heat mitigation solutions employed by this 'Mech provide for an excellent low-risk technology demonstration.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Breaching Shot</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.15</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_excalibur"
  },
